{"seq":5,"slug":"task-scheduling-algorithms","title":"任务调度算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/task-scheduling-algorithms","wordCount":987,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务调度算法\">任务调度算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入式实时操作系统的核心职责是确保任务在截止时间之前完成执行。任务调度算法决定了在多个就绪任务竞争 CPU 时，系统如何选择下一个执行的任务。调度算法的选择直接影响系统的实时性保证、CPU 利用率和响应延迟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[任务调度算法] --&gt; B[静态优先级]&#10;    A --&gt; C[动态优先级]&#10;    A --&gt; D[混合调度]&#10;    B --&gt; E[RM 速率单调]&#10;    B --&gt; F[DM 截止时间单调]&#10;    C --&gt; G[EDF 最早截止时间优先]&#10;    C --&gt; H[LLF 最小松弛优先]&#10;    D --&gt; I[固定优先级 + 时间片]&#10;    D --&gt; J[分层调度]\">graph TD\n    A[任务调度算法] --&gt; B[静态优先级]\n    A --&gt; C[动态优先级]\n    A --&gt; D[混合调度]\n    B --&gt; E[RM 速率单调]\n    B --&gt; F[DM 截止时间单调]\n    C --&gt; G[EDF 最早截止时间优先]\n    C --&gt; H[LLF 最小松弛优先]\n    D --&gt; I[固定优先级 + 时间片]\n    D --&gt; J[分层调度]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调度算法</th>\n<th>优先级类型</th>\n<th>最优性</th>\n<th>可调度性分析</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RM（Rate Monotonic）</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>最优（固定优先级）</td>\n<td>U ≤ n(2^(1/n)-1)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>FreeRTOS、VxWorks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DM（Deadline Monotonic）</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>最优（D ≤ T）</td>\n<td>响应时间分析</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>安全关键系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EDF（Earliest Deadline First）</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>最优（单处理器）</td>\n<td>U ≤ 1</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>学术研究、部分 RTOS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLF（Least Laxity First）</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n<td>U ≤ 1</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>理论研究</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Round Robin</td>\n<td>无/相同</td>\n<td>非最优</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通用 OS、非实时任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"速率单调调度-rm\">速率单调调度 RM</h2><p>速率单调调度（Rate Monotonic Scheduling）是最经典的静态优先级调度算法。其核心规则是：周期越短的任务优先级越高。RM 在所有固定优先级算法中是最优的——如果一个任务集在任何固定优先级算法下可调度，那么在 RM 下也一定可调度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可调度性判定\">可调度性判定</h3><p>RM 的充分条件（Liu &amp; Layland 界）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"U = Σ(Ci/Ti) ≤ n × (2^(1/n) - 1)&#10;&#10;其中：&#10;  n = 任务数量&#10;  Ci = 任务 i 的最坏执行时间（WCET）&#10;  Ti = 任务 i 的周期&#10;  U = CPU 利用率&#10;&#10;n=1: U ≤ 1.000 (100%)&#10;n=2: U ≤ 0.828 (82.8%)&#10;n=3: U ≤ 0.780 (78.0%)&#10;n→∞: U ≤ ln(2) ≈ 0.693 (69.3%)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>U = Σ(Ci/Ti) ≤ n × (2^(1/n) - 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>其中：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  n = 任务数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Ci = 任务 i 的最坏执行时间（WCET）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Ti = 任务 i 的周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  U = CPU 利用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n=1: U ≤ 1.000 (100%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n=2: U ≤ 0.828 (82.8%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n=3: U ≤ 0.780 (78.0%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n→∞: U ≤ ln(2) ≈ 0.693 (69.3%)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实际案例\">实际案例</h3><p>考虑三个周期任务：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>周期 Ti</th>\n<th>执行时间 Ci</th>\n<th>利用率 Ci/Ti</th>\n<th>RM 优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>τ1</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>2ms</td>\n<td>0.200</td>\n<td>最高（周期最短）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>τ2</td>\n<td>20ms</td>\n<td>3ms</td>\n<td>0.150</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>τ3</td>\n<td>50ms</td>\n<td>8ms</td>\n<td>0.160</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>总利用率 U = 0.200 + 0.150 + 0.160 = 0.510，小于 3×(2^(1/3)-1) ≈ 0.780，因此可调度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// FreeRTOS 中按 RM 原则设置优先级&#10;xTaskCreate(task1_handler, &quot;Task1&quot;, 256, NULL, 3, NULL);  // 周期 10ms → 最高优先级&#10;xTaskCreate(task2_handler, &quot;Task2&quot;, 256, NULL, 2, NULL);  // 周期 20ms → 中优先级&#10;xTaskCreate(task3_handler, &quot;Task3&quot;, 512, NULL, 1, NULL);  // 周期 50ms → 最低优先级&#10;&#10;void task1_handler(void *params) {&#10;    TickType_t xLastWakeTime = xTaskGetTickCount();&#10;    for (;;) {&#10;        // 执行传感器采样（WCET ≤ 2ms）&#10;        read_sensor_data();&#10;        vTaskDelayUntil(&amp;xLastWakeTime, pdMS_TO_TICKS(10));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FreeRTOS 中按 RM 原则设置优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xTaskCreate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task1_handler, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Task1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 周期 10ms → 最高优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xTaskCreate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task2_handler, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Task2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 周期 20ms → 中优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xTaskCreate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task3_handler, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Task3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 周期 50ms → 最低优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> task1_handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    TickType_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xLastWakeTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xTaskGetTickCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (;;) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 执行传感器采样（WCET ≤ 2ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        read_sensor_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        vTaskDelayUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xLastWakeTime, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"edf-最早截止时间优先\">EDF 最早截止时间优先</h2><p>EDF（Earliest Deadline First）是最优的动态优先级调度算法。每个调度时刻，EDF 选择绝对截止时间最近的任务执行。在单处理器上，EDF 可以调度所有利用率不超过 100% 的任务集，这是任何算法能达到的理论上限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"edf-vs-rm-对比\">EDF vs RM 对比</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// EDF 伪代码实现&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    uint32_t deadline;    // 绝对截止时间&#10;    uint32_t period;&#10;    uint32_t wcet;&#10;    void (*handler)(void);&#10;} edf_task_t;&#10;&#10;void edf_scheduler(edf_task_t *tasks, int n) {&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        edf_task_t *next = NULL;&#10;        uint32_t earliest = UINT32_MAX;&#10;&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;            if (tasks[i].deadline &lt; earliest &amp;&amp; is_ready(&amp;tasks[i])) {&#10;                earliest = tasks[i].deadline;&#10;                next = &amp;tasks[i];&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        if (next) {&#10;            execute(next);&#10;            next-&gt;deadline += next-&gt;period;&#10;        } else {&#10;            idle();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// EDF 伪代码实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deadline;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 绝对截止时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> period;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wcet;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">handler)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">edf_task_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> edf_scheduler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">edf_task_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        edf_task_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> earliest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UINT32_MAX;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> earliest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_ready</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                earliest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i].deadline;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (next) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            next->deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next->period;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            idle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>RM</th>\n<th>EDF</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 利用率上限</td>\n<td>~69.3%（渐进）</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级变化</td>\n<td>固定不变</td>\n<td>每次调度可能变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过载行为</td>\n<td>低优先级任务失败</td>\n<td>不可预测（级联失败）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>简单（固定映射）</td>\n<td>需维护截止时间队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文切换</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n<td>较多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业采用</td>\n<td>广泛（FreeRTOS、VxWorks）</td>\n<td>有限（LITMUS^RT）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可分析性</td>\n<td>强（成熟工具链）</td>\n<td>中（理论更简洁）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优先级反转与继承\">优先级反转与继承</h2><p>优先级反转是实时系统中最危险的调度异常：低优先级任务持有高优先级任务所需的资源，而中优先级任务抢占低优先级任务执行，间接阻塞了高优先级任务。1997 年火星探路者号任务就因优先级反转导致系统反复重启。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[优先级反转问题] --&gt; B[优先级继承协议 PIP]&#10;    A --&gt; C[优先级天花板协议 PCP]&#10;    A --&gt; D[禁止中断方案]&#10;    B --&gt; E[临时提升持锁任务优先级]&#10;    C --&gt; F[资源获取时立即提升到天花板优先级]&#10;    D --&gt; G[仅适用于极短临界区]\">graph LR\n    A[优先级反转问题] --&gt; B[优先级继承协议 PIP]\n    A --&gt; C[优先级天花板协议 PCP]\n    A --&gt; D[禁止中断方案]\n    B --&gt; E[临时提升持锁任务优先级]\n    C --&gt; F[资源获取时立即提升到天花板优先级]\n    D --&gt; G[仅适用于极短临界区]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// FreeRTOS 优先级继承示例&#10;SemaphoreHandle_t mutex = xSemaphoreCreateMutex();&#10;// FreeRTOS 的 Mutex 默认启用优先级继承&#10;&#10;// 高优先级任务&#10;void high_priority_task(void *params) {&#10;    for (;;) {&#10;        xSemaphoreTake(mutex, portMAX_DELAY);&#10;        // 访问共享资源&#10;        access_shared_resource();&#10;        xSemaphoreGive(mutex);&#10;        vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(10));&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 低优先级任务持有 mutex 时，&#10;// 若高优先级任务尝试获取 mutex，&#10;// 低优先级任务的优先级会被临时提升到高优先级任务的级别\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FreeRTOS 优先级继承示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SemaphoreHandle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mutex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xSemaphoreCreateMutex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FreeRTOS 的 Mutex 默认启用优先级继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 高优先级任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> high_priority_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (;;) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        xSemaphoreTake</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mutex, portMAX_DELAY);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 访问共享资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        access_shared_resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        xSemaphoreGive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mutex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        vTaskDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 低优先级任务持有 mutex 时，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 若高优先级任务尝试获取 mutex，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 低优先级任务的优先级会被临时提升到高优先级任务的级别</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>阻塞上界</th>\n<th>死锁风险</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>RTOS 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无保护</td>\n<td>无界</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级继承 PIP</td>\n<td>最多 n 个临界区</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>FreeRTOS、μC/OS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级天花板 PCP</td>\n<td>最多 1 个临界区</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>VxWorks、RTEMS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立即天花板 IPCP</td>\n<td>最多 1 个临界区</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>POSIX（PRIO_PROTECT）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RM 是固定优先级调度的最优算法，规则简单（周期越短优先级越高），工业界广泛采用</li>\n<li>EDF 是动态优先级调度的最优算法，可实现 100% CPU 利用率，但过载行为不可预测</li>\n<li>RM 的可调度性通过 Liu &amp; Layland 界快速判定，精确判定需要响应时间分析</li>\n<li>优先级反转是实时系统的致命隐患，必须通过优先级继承或天花板协议解决</li>\n<li>工业实践中 RM 占主导地位，EDF 更多出现在学术研究和特定高利用率场景</li>\n<li>调度算法选择需要在可预测性、CPU 利用率和实现复杂度之间权衡</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务调度算法","id":"任务调度算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"速率单调调度 RM","id":"速率单调调度-rm"},{"level":3,"text":"可调度性判定","id":"可调度性判定"},{"level":3,"text":"实际案例","id":"实际案例"},{"level":2,"text":"EDF 最早截止时间优先","id":"edf-最早截止时间优先"},{"level":3,"text":"EDF vs RM 对比","id":"edf-vs-rm-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级反转与继承","id":"优先级反转与继承"},{"level":3,"text":"解决方案","id":"解决方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时约束与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/real-time-constraints"},"next":{"title":"Zephyr RTOS 与现代嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/zephyr-and-modern-frameworks"}}